# 7-Zip C++ sources, split to avoid compiling the shared core twice.
#
#   cpp_7z_common : the 258 sources shared by the console tool and the
#                   file manager (archive formats, codecs, common UI). Compiled
#                   once; both libs below depend on it.
#   cpp_7zip      : console-only sources (UI/Console, Main, std streams) +
#                   Z7_PROG_VARIANT_Z. Used by the 7zz bundle.
#   cpp_7zfm      : file-manager-only sources (UI/FileManager, Agent, Explorer)
#                   + Z7_LANG. Used by the 7zFM bundle.
# The shared sources use neither Z7_PROG_VARIANT_Z nor Z7_LANG (verified), so
# moving them into one lib is behavior-preserving.

